---

// TODO
// Adapt to Astro component w/ possible remark plugin for converting raw markdown content to Astro component in the future

// ABOUT: Diplays output in a vertical stepper format.
//
// ```
// 1. Step 1
//    ...
// 2. Step 2
//    ...
// 3. Step 3
//    ...
//    ...
// ```
// 
// MORE STEPPERS AVAILABLE: https://preline.co/docs/components/stepper.html



---

<!-- Stepper -->
<!-- https://preline.co/docs/components/stepper.html#vertical-white -->
<!-- MORE STEPPERS AVAILABLE: https://preline.co/docs/components/stepper.html  -->

<ul class="relative flex flex-col gap-y-2">
  <!-- Item -->
  <li class="flex gap-x-4 group">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
      <span class="flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-medium border rounded-full size-7 shrink-0 bg-layer border-layer-line text-layer-foreground">
        1
      </span>
      <div class="flex-1 w-px h-full mt-2 bg-surface-1 group-last:hidden"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pb-6 grow group-last:pb-0">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center text-xs align-middle min-w-7 min-h-7">
        <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-foreground">
          Workspace info
        </span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground-1">
        Add the workspace name, choose a clear description, and set the core details teammates will see when they join.
      </p>
    </div>
  </li>
  <!-- End Item -->

  <!-- Item -->
  <li class="flex gap-x-4 group">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
      <span class="flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-medium border rounded-full size-7 shrink-0 bg-layer border-layer-line text-layer-foreground">
        2
      </span>
      <div class="flex-1 w-px h-full mt-2 bg-surface-1 group-last:hidden"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pb-6 grow group-last:pb-0">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center text-xs align-middle min-w-7 min-h-7">
        <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-foreground">
          Member setup
        </span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground-1">
        Invite your team, assign responsibilities, and review the access each person should have before moving forward.
      </p>
    </div>
  </li>
  <!-- End Item -->

  <!-- Item -->
  <li class="flex gap-x-4 group">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
      <span class="flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-medium border rounded-full size-7 shrink-0 bg-layer border-layer-line text-layer-foreground">
        3
      </span>
      <div class="flex-1 w-px h-full mt-2 bg-surface-1 group-last:hidden"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pb-6 grow group-last:pb-0">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center text-xs align-middle min-w-7 min-h-7">
        <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-foreground">
          Final check
        </span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground-1">
        Confirm the settings, review the summary, and publish the setup once everything is ready for the next stage.
      </p>
    </div>
  </li>
  <!-- End Item -->
</ul>
<!-- End Stepper -->

